    "description": {
      "value": "You shoot a blazing ray of light tinged with holy energy. Make a ranged spell attack. The ray deals 5d6 fire damage. If the target has the unholy, you deal an extra 5d6 spirit damage.\n\nCritical Success: The target takes double damage.\nSuccess: The target takes full damage.\n\nIf the light passes through an area of magical darkness or targets a creature affected by magical darkness, holy light attempts to counteract the darkness. If you need to determine whether the light passes through an area of darkness, draw a line between yourself and the spell's target."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): The fire damage increases by 2d6, and the spirit damage against unholy creatures increases by 2d6."
    },
